\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017182143\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 149/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1938/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 141/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4305/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,t